  "description": "When Hwang Jin-Woo stumbles into a gay bar, he accidentally crosses paths with the seemingly cold and aloof Baek Woo-Seok. After a few too many drinks, Jin-Woo lets slip some embarrassing words, and one thing leads to another—they end up spending the night together. But what Jin-Woo thinks is a one-and-done deal, Woo-Seok seems to think is the start of something more! Jin-Woo needs to come up with a plan to break this off, and quick. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
